<title>ROMANIA: RADIO ROMANIA AFTERNOON HEADLINES.</title>
<headline>RADIO ROMANIA AFTERNOON HEADLINES.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Radio Romania news:</p>
<p>* Romania's Foreign Ministry hails the introduction of a bill in the United States Congress urging NATO membership for Romania, Estonia, Latvia and Lithuania as soon as they meet membership requirements.</p>
<p>* Romania's King Michael will start a private visit to coincide with Orthodox Easter celebrations.</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
